<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>Ticker on every news story</b> — each story in the Home feed now shows a clear ticker badge for the stock it's about (the one you follow), plus any other related tickers, so you can tell at a glance which of your holdings the news concerns.</li>
    <li><b>Faster update checks</b> — StockDock now checks for new versions a few times a day, so you get improvements sooner.</li>
</ul>
